<note><title>Pancakes &amp; more</title><created>20240102T030405Z</created><updated>20250607T080910Z</updated><tag>Breakfast</tag><tag>Quick meals</tag><tag>2024</tag><note-attributes><author>Matt</author><source-url>https://example.com/clip</source-url></note-attributes><content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><h1>Pancakes</h1><div>Makes <b>eight</b>, <i>thin</i> and <span style="font-weight: bold;">golden</span>, <s>never</s> <u>burnt</u>.</div><div><br/></div><div>Weigh &amp; mix: 2 * 100&nbsp;g flour</div><div>Line one<br/>Line two</div>
<h2>Shopping</h2>
<div><en-todo checked="true"/>Eggs</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>Milk</div>
<ul style="--en-todo:true;"><li style="--en-checked:true;"><div>Butter</div></li><li><div>Lemons</div></li></ul>
<ol><li>Mix</li><li>Rest<ul><li>ten minutes</li><li>covered</li></ul></li><li>Fry</li></ol>
<table><tr><th>Item</th><th>Grams</th></tr><tr><td>Flour</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><td>Sugar | fine</td><td>20</td></tr></table>
<blockquote><div>Rest the batter.</div></blockquote><hr/>
<div style="-en-codeblock:true;"><div>let x = 1;</div><div>  if (x &lt; 2) x++;</div></div>
<div>Run <code>make pancakes</code> then see <a href="https://example.com/pancakes">the recipe</a> and <a href="evernote:///view/123/s1/abc/abc/">Waffles</a>.</div>
